      "writtenOn": "2024-08-29T15:37:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Argument buffers have the function ’setIndirectCommandBuffer’ which allows us to pass the ICB to the shader. The compute command encoder does not have that, so we need to use the argument buffer to pass the ICB. Also since we need to use AB, we can put all the buffers that we are going to need per multidraw inside the argument buffer.",
